# UnrealMCP Toolsets

The UE 5.6.1 server currently registers **429 tools across 25 toolsets**. Search
mode exposes only `list_toolsets`, `describe_toolset`, and `call_tool`; use the
live `describe_toolset` result as the authority for exact arguments and policy.

Verified catalog snapshot: 2026-08-27.

